  "stem": "The potential energy of a 1 kg particle free to move along the x-axis is given by $V(x) = \\left( \\frac{x^{4}}{4} - \\frac{x^{2}}{2} \\right).\\ $The total mechanical energy of the particle is 2 J. Then, the maximum speed (in m$s^{- 1}$) is:",
